# one word plays every sound (decision play-one-word): a list one item after another, each the duration long, a chord
# or a nested list in it together; a chord together; a score written as data as a list; tone, melody and tune are
# play's aliases; chord(C4, major) is a Chord
'use sound; play([C4 E4 G4], 100ms); round(sound.seconds * 10)'	3
'use sound; play([C4+E4 G4], 100ms); round(sound.seconds * 10)'	2
'use sound; play([[C4 E4] G4], 100ms); round(sound.seconds * 10)'	2
'use sound; play(C4+E4+G4, 100ms); round(sound.seconds * 10)'	1
'use sound; melody([C4 E4 G4], 100ms); round(sound.seconds * 10)'	3
